  "contract_id": "gemm_a8w8_blockscale_bpreshuffle@1.0",
  "description": "fp8 gemm dequantized per block: a fp32 scale per 128 x 128 of WQ, per 1 x 128 of XQ, K-major or MN-major. operand_format is '<XQ>:<WQ>'; 'none:preshuffled' is aiter's 16 x 16 shuffle_weight WQ with a raw column-major a_scale. Set x_scale.is_row_major to pass a row-major a_scale with a shuffled WQ.",
